{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Demo is also in the works :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into Your Own Psyche</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Golden Self</i></strong> is a surreal action roguelike about confronting the fragments of who you are.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle inner demons, explore shifting dreamscapes, and uncover the truth waiting at your core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.poster.avif?t=1761519040\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.webm?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.mp4?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive combat where every strike matters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain dodges, abilities, and weapon forms to survive the ever-changing trials of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/fc5ce0d468d5f95cd901743e6a849ad2.poster.avif?t=1761519040\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/fc5ce0d468d5f95cd901743e6a849ad2.webm?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/fc5ce0d468d5f95cd901743e6a849ad2.mp4?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powers that alter your playstyle with each run.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with builds, abilities, and relics as you grow stronger \u2014 or spiral deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/9bd1274523af7d32fda1d50291d5b9ea.poster.avif?t=1761519040\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/9bd1274523af7d32fda1d50291d5b9ea.webm?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/9bd1274523af7d32fda1d50291d5b9ea.mp4?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay and Rebuild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is another chance to understand yourself.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, overcome, and descend again, drawing from a pool of over 440 items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.poster.avif?t=1761519040\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.webm?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.mp4?t=1761519040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel Your Inner Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the seven different endings, each revealing a diffe